WEBVTT

00:04.110 --> 00:04.800
There it is!

00:05.940 --> 00:06.890
It's that cat!

00:07.980 --> 00:08.730
Wait!

00:13.950 --> 00:15.110
Got you!

00:16.120 --> 00:17.240
Damn it...

00:19.180 --> 00:20.310
She disappeared.

00:27.840 --> 00:29.420
Pole: Nankai Hone University

00:27.850 --> 00:29.420
Hey, Katsura!

00:29.960 --> 00:31.560
Katsura Rindou!

01:54.810 --> 01:57.720
What's about to start is a story of meetings and farewells.

01:57.720 --> 01:59.720
Kyouran Kazoku Nikki, starting.

02:18.440 --> 02:19.970
Katsura Rindou!

02:21.270 --> 02:23.110
You got time after this?

02:23.110 --> 02:24.010
Why?

02:24.860 --> 02:27.400
We're short on guys for the mixer.

02:27.400 --> 02:29.110
No, I've got to...

02:29.110 --> 02:30.430
The girls are OL's.

02:30.430 --> 02:32.090
Older Ladies.

02:32.090 --> 02:33.530
So you're coming, right?

02:33.530 --> 02:35.630
Sorry, but I got a job to go to.

02:35.630 --> 02:37.670
What? You're joking, right?

02:37.670 --> 02:39.170
Rindou!

02:39.170 --> 02:40.090
Forget about him.

02:40.290 --> 02:41.770
Remember, he's...

02:47.760 --> 02:51.940
It's not like I wish for a rosy college life,

02:52.470 --> 02:56.290
but my life lacks in excitement as if I'm forsaken by God.

02:57.880 --> 03:00.400
Here, Kaori-chan. Say "Ah".

03:00.400 --> 03:01.820
Stop it, Takashi.

03:01.820 --> 03:03.700
"Ah".

03:03.700 --> 03:07.330
Nothing interesting happened today, either.

03:03.700 --> 03:06.290
"Ah."

03:08.670 --> 03:10.160
Thank you for coming.

03:11.890 --> 03:16.280
Born normally. Live normally. Die normally.

03:18.550 --> 03:21.840
Maybe a life like that is suited for me.

03:21.840 --> 03:22.470
Probably.

03:29.450 --> 03:33.090
Then, on a Monday, I picked up a cat.

03:36.960 --> 03:39.480
Thinking back, I must have been lonely.

03:40.320 --> 03:42.480
I said things unlike me.

03:43.470 --> 03:45.490
Want to get out of the rain at my place?

03:49.660 --> 03:50.930
That should do it.

03:52.430 --> 03:54.990
I'm not supposed to keep pets in this apartment, right?

03:55.490 --> 03:58.690
Oh well. I'm not going to keep it anyway.

03:59.090 --> 04:00.340
Just tonight, okay?

04:01.920 --> 04:03.630
Do you really understand?

04:28.370 --> 04:29.850
Rindou-kun!

04:29.850 --> 04:31.550
What are you doing in such a big rush?

04:31.550 --> 04:33.780
Th-The cat's...

04:33.780 --> 04:35.230
Cat? You're keeping a cat?

04:35.230 --> 04:35.790
No...

04:35.790 --> 04:39.250
I get it. Rindou-kun, you must be soothing your loneliness with a cat.

04:39.250 --> 04:42.320
If you would have told me, I would have comforted you.

04:42.320 --> 04:43.300
Get off of me!

04:57.350 --> 04:59.550
Why is there a girl in my room?

05:00.860 --> 05:01.640
No!

05:01.640 --> 05:04.110
I didn't bring back a girl after getting drunk, did I?!

05:04.110 --> 05:05.530
It can't be!

05:05.530 --> 05:10.620
I might not be having the best life, but as a college student, I was doing my best to fit into society, and...

05:10.910 --> 05:14.150
Of all the misdeeds, how could I commit such a lustful crime...

05:14.150 --> 05:15.870
She even has cat ears.

05:16.770 --> 05:17.580
Cat ears?

05:20.990 --> 05:23.860
Oh, sorry. It was wiggling, so I couldn't help it.

05:24.790 --> 05:27.880
Watch it. The tail's sensitive.

05:31.350 --> 05:33.640
No... that can't be possible.

05:35.550 --> 05:37.400
Are you the cat from last night?

05:37.860 --> 05:41.460
I've been a cat since I was born, so I'm Cat.

05:41.460 --> 05:44.220
Thanks for the incomprehensible answer.

05:44.770 --> 05:45.690
Okay, let's try this.

05:45.940 --> 05:52.920
You must be an illusion my lonely heart created... or something like that.

05:54.670 --> 05:59.210
So, leave without a trace while I'm gone to school.

05:59.550 --> 06:00.510
Okay?

06:01.170 --> 06:02.230
I'm off.

06:15.710 --> 06:16.850
Rindou-kun.

06:17.340 --> 06:20.000
I brought you food for the cat.

06:22.590 --> 06:23.570
Cat?

06:28.200 --> 06:29.780
Illusion my ass...

06:30.010 --> 06:32.330
This is pretty bad, isn't it?

06:33.070 --> 06:36.410
People, the world's come to a strange thing.

06:36.410 --> 06:38.630
"An ordinary college student", what did he do?

06:38.630 --> 06:40.770
"Locks a cat ear girl in his room!"

06:40.770 --> 06:43.120
I had a feeling something like this would happen soon.

06:43.120 --> 06:46.920
He was always staring at me.

06:47.880 --> 06:50.890
The trust I've been building to today will crumble!

06:51.460 --> 06:52.390
Why?

06:53.040 --> 06:55.480
Why did such a unique flag come up?

06:54.800 --> 06:56.970
Takashi, say "Ah".

06:57.100 --> 06:58.560
Rindou-kun!

06:57.260 --> 06:58.560
"Ah"

06:59.290 --> 07:02.300
Rindou-kun, if you don't hurry, we'll be late!

07:03.010 --> 07:04.250
Rindou-kun.

07:04.250 --> 07:05.590
Rindou-kun.

07:07.450 --> 07:08.780
Rindou-kun...

07:10.360 --> 07:12.620
Rindou-kun... I...

07:12.620 --> 07:13.910
That's wrong!

07:14.210 --> 07:15.690
I'm supposed to be normal!

07:15.690 --> 07:19.500
My brain just made up a love story that didn't even happen!

07:21.160 --> 07:23.300
Calm down, Katsura Rindou.

07:25.070 --> 07:27.160
Welcome home, darling.

07:27.730 --> 07:29.840
Welcome home, Onii-chan.

07:30.820 --> 07:32.630
What's that reaction?

07:41.260 --> 07:42.930
I've got two things to ask.

07:42.930 --> 07:44.490
I'll give you a treat if you answer them.

07:44.490 --> 07:45.620
Treat?!

07:45.620 --> 07:46.730
What is it? A kiss?

07:46.730 --> 07:48.020
Hey now...

07:48.020 --> 07:50.630
One: Why is this person here?

07:50.630 --> 07:52.820
She told me the situation.

07:53.280 --> 07:55.590
The kitty lost her memory she said.

07:55.590 --> 07:56.720
It must have been difficult.

07:56.720 --> 07:59.970
Yeah, but Onii-chan picked me up, so I'm fine now.

07:59.970 --> 08:01.890
What a good girl!

08:01.890 --> 08:03.370
Stop right there.

08:03.370 --> 08:05.320
What's with the "Onii-chan"?

08:05.320 --> 08:09.960
Onee-san said guys like to be called "Onii-chan".

08:10.850 --> 08:13.510
You shouldn't listen to suspicious people like this!

08:13.510 --> 08:16.540
Onee-san is a strange person, but not a bad person.

08:16.340 --> 08:17.310
Yup, yup.

08:16.540 --> 08:19.260
So whatever she says shouldn't be bad either.

08:19.260 --> 08:23.040
So I must call you Onii-chan,

08:23.040 --> 08:28.560
and you must make me wear school swimsuits and maid uniforms and get turned on over it.

08:29.190 --> 08:30.820
What are you teaching her?!

08:31.580 --> 08:33.220
I-I give up!

08:33.550 --> 08:34.740
All right, second question.

08:35.160 --> 08:36.680
Why are you still here?

08:37.650 --> 08:39.020
Can't you tell?

08:39.020 --> 08:41.040
I don't have money or strength.

08:41.510 --> 08:45.210
I can't do anything even if you relied on me.
I can't teach you anything, either.

08:46.040 --> 08:48.150
I'm a real useless human.

08:48.940 --> 08:49.540
Yet...

08:50.350 --> 08:53.080
Why are you waiting for me to come home like that's the natural thing to do?

08:55.340 --> 08:56.430
Don't know.

08:56.430 --> 08:57.470
I see...

08:58.010 --> 08:59.980
But I think...

09:00.500 --> 09:03.080
...you're not as bad as you say you are.

09:03.640 --> 09:05.480
You were kind to me.

09:05.930 --> 09:08.370
I was really happy, you know?

09:15.150 --> 09:19.150
Now that things are settled, let's clean this place up.

09:19.150 --> 09:20.680
Cleaning!

09:24.190 --> 09:28.380
This is how the cat and my strange rooming began.

09:25.210 --> 09:28.040
Cleaning! Cleaning!

09:39.790 --> 09:41.220
Yay!

10:00.450 --> 10:05.430
Frankly, the life with the cat was too happy for me.

10:05.950 --> 10:10.810
So... So I had completely forgotten about...

10:17.470 --> 10:20.510
...how sinful of a guy I am.

10:24.680 --> 10:26.550
There he is!

10:28.270 --> 10:30.600
Hey, Onii-chan!

10:30.600 --> 10:31.840
Hey, did you hear that?

10:31.840 --> 10:33.810
Yeah, she said "Onii-chan". Is she insane?

10:33.810 --> 10:36.020
He can't hear me?

10:36.020 --> 10:37.950
Onii-chan!

10:37.950 --> 10:39.250
Katsura Rindou.

10:39.900 --> 10:44.240
Is this Japanese cat-ear girl someone you know?

10:44.440 --> 10:46.570
No, I don't know her at all!

10:46.570 --> 10:49.560
That poor looking creature and I are unrelated.

10:49.560 --> 10:55.160
It's a mystery why she knows my name,
so I think I'll have to ask her a few questions.

10:55.820 --> 10:59.630
I need to clear up a few things,
so I'll skip the rest of the class if I may.

10:59.630 --> 11:02.540
Don't worry, I understand.

11:02.540 --> 11:06.760
May the God bless Japanese lovers.

11:06.760 --> 11:08.840
Everyone, a round of applause.

11:12.700 --> 11:15.260
How did you come here?

11:16.030 --> 11:18.190
Onee-san drew a map for me.

11:18.540 --> 11:20.120
That bastard...

11:24.160 --> 11:26.030
Gosh...

11:26.850 --> 11:28.420
Stay still.

11:30.110 --> 11:31.910
It's all sticky.

11:31.910 --> 11:33.290
Go wash your face.

11:37.910 --> 11:40.460
It's nice to be married, isn't it?

11:40.460 --> 11:41.580
No, we're not married.

11:41.580 --> 11:43.380
Nothing to be embarrassed about.

11:43.380 --> 11:46.330
Before love, neither race nor age is a problem.

11:46.330 --> 11:48.430
The latter could be a crime depending on the situation.

11:49.390 --> 11:51.130
Katsura Rindou.

11:51.130 --> 11:53.720
You are a good diligent student.

11:54.130 --> 11:58.410
I'm glad to have met a student like you.

12:04.290 --> 12:06.750
Sensei, to be honest, I...

12:13.410 --> 12:15.060
You're Katsura Rindou, right?

12:19.840 --> 12:21.670
You're Katsura Rindou, right?

12:23.450 --> 12:25.490
Yeah, that's me.

12:25.490 --> 12:27.300
Come with us.

12:28.930 --> 12:34.020
This is school, and he is my student.

12:34.020 --> 12:36.080
If you have a business with him, tell me-

12:36.080 --> 12:36.940
It's fine, Sensei.

12:37.210 --> 12:39.440
I knew this was going to happen sooner or later.

12:42.620 --> 12:44.600
Let's end it all.

12:45.270 --> 12:46.890
It's time this fake life ended.

12:51.980 --> 12:53.200
Everyone...

12:53.770 --> 12:54.830
Everyone, listen to me.

12:55.590 --> 12:56.450
I'm...

12:56.450 --> 12:59.310
I'm actually not a college student.

13:09.450 --> 13:11.280
I failed entrance exams twice...

13:11.890 --> 13:13.890
Didn't get any support from my parents...

13:16.420 --> 13:20.680
Even so, I wanted to get the taste of a college life.

13:21.270 --> 13:25.020
I'm a fake student that was just hanging out...

13:25.530 --> 13:26.910
I knew that.

13:28.410 --> 13:30.200
Not a single absent or tardy the entire year.

13:30.360 --> 13:32.120
Always sitting at the front.

13:32.120 --> 13:34.090
Handing in reports faster than anyone.

13:34.090 --> 13:36.660
Checks the bulletin board frequently when there's no need to.

13:36.660 --> 13:40.060
A regular at this cafeteria.

13:40.060 --> 13:41.070
I knew all of that.

13:41.070 --> 13:41.790
Sensei...

13:41.790 --> 13:46.290
You are still my precious student.

13:48.040 --> 13:48.960
Sensei!

13:48.960 --> 13:50.160
Katsura Rindou.

13:50.160 --> 13:51.540
That's enough!

13:52.290 --> 13:53.820
Where is Milcatopy?

13:53.820 --> 13:56.550
We know you have her.

13:56.550 --> 13:57.930
Milcatopy?

13:57.930 --> 13:59.850
You're not here to arrest me?

13:59.850 --> 14:02.250
We won't go easy on you if you keep hiding her.

14:08.420 --> 14:11.440
I know. Those are guns.

14:11.440 --> 14:15.190
Yes, I know. It hurts when you get shot with those, right?

14:15.190 --> 14:19.000
Don't worry, we intend to capture you unharmed.

14:17.620 --> 14:18.370
Cat!

14:19.000 --> 14:21.210
So as long as you stay quiet-

14:25.130 --> 14:27.490
It's dangerous to point such dangerous things at people!

14:27.490 --> 14:29.150
Don't you even know that?!

14:29.150 --> 14:30.430
I'm disappointed!

14:30.430 --> 14:31.850
Very disappointed!

14:31.850 --> 14:32.950
You...

14:32.950 --> 14:33.820
Get her-

14:34.560 --> 14:36.890
Katsura Rindou, get out of here.

14:36.890 --> 14:37.680
Sensei!

14:42.270 --> 14:43.690
Let's go, Cat!

14:45.930 --> 14:47.110
Where are we going?

14:47.110 --> 14:48.360
Don't know.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.320
There he is!

14:52.320 --> 14:53.600
Kao-rin...

14:53.600 --> 14:54.990
Takashi...

14:58.330 --> 14:59.500
Wait!

14:59.500 --> 15:01.910
You're so mean to run through them, Onii-chan.

15:01.910 --> 15:02.860
It's an emergency!

15:04.500 --> 15:05.840
Onee-san!

15:05.840 --> 15:06.650
Why are you here?

15:06.650 --> 15:07.880
We'll talk later. Get in.

15:10.530 --> 15:12.180
Looks like we got away.

15:12.180 --> 15:13.750
Why are you here?

15:13.750 --> 15:16.560
Those guys were sniffing around the neighborhood.

15:16.560 --> 15:19.780
I had a bad feeling, so I came. Good thing I did.

15:19.780 --> 15:21.730
Who are those guys?

15:23.070 --> 15:24.690
Sorabone City Guards.

15:25.120 --> 15:26.150
Sorabone City?

15:26.770 --> 15:30.560
A city made by the country to isolate all spirits.

15:31.280 --> 15:33.950
Kitty came escaping from there, right?

15:39.010 --> 15:42.120
My name is Milcatopy.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.570
Milcatopy?

15:43.570 --> 15:47.800
My home is holy United States, far from here.

15:47.800 --> 15:50.690
A country where spirits like me are everywhere.

15:50.690 --> 15:53.250
That's where my mother is.

15:55.040 --> 15:57.680
A very kind, wonderful mother.

15:57.680 --> 16:02.230
But Mother's sick. I need to get her medicine.

16:02.230 --> 16:05.250
But I need lots of money for that.

16:05.580 --> 16:07.110
Why didn't you ever tell me that?

16:07.560 --> 16:09.840
I always told myself that I'd have to.

16:10.200 --> 16:12.360
But when I did...

16:12.810 --> 16:17.110
If you found out that I'm a spirit,
I was afraid that you'd hate me.

16:20.260 --> 16:21.350
It's all right now.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.290
Onii-chan...

16:24.690 --> 16:25.710
Onee-san.

16:25.710 --> 16:26.670
I know.

16:28.360 --> 16:31.870
I'll take you to a wonderful place.

16:38.720 --> 16:39.970
Get out.

16:40.160 --> 16:41.850
Don't say that.

16:41.850 --> 16:43.940
Please, Drinda-chan.

16:43.940 --> 16:46.530
My place isn't a nursing home.

16:46.530 --> 16:48.310
You want me to hide these two kids here?

16:48.310 --> 16:50.460
You moron! Wanna die?

16:50.460 --> 16:51.870
Calm down.

16:51.870 --> 16:53.010
Please!

16:53.610 --> 16:55.480
I'll do anything.

16:55.480 --> 16:57.490
Please protect me from the people of Sorabone City.

16:57.490 --> 17:00.140
Let me work here.

17:00.140 --> 17:02.340
"Do anything", eh?

17:03.700 --> 17:04.600
No way!

17:04.600 --> 17:08.670
Don't panic. They can't come into my place that easily.

17:08.670 --> 17:09.840
But this is perfect.

17:10.130 --> 17:11.550
Milcatopy, right?

17:11.550 --> 17:12.500
Yes.

17:12.500 --> 17:16.450
If you have the resolution to do anything, then take care of the guards yourself.

17:17.470 --> 17:20.560
Sorabone City's security is close to nothing.

17:20.560 --> 17:24.410
Take care of the guys coming after you right now,
and then you're practically free.

17:24.410 --> 17:27.130
Drinda-chan, you're being too hard on her.

17:27.130 --> 17:28.340
You stay out of this!

17:29.280 --> 17:30.600
I'll do something about it.

17:31.750 --> 17:33.680
I'll take care of them.

17:34.160 --> 17:36.650
So please let Cat work here.

17:36.650 --> 17:37.410
You're being ridiculous.

17:37.410 --> 17:38.160
Give it a try.

17:38.160 --> 17:39.530
Cat needs money, right?

17:39.530 --> 17:40.240
Then I'll let her!

17:40.500 --> 17:41.520
Onii-chan!

17:41.520 --> 17:42.160
Rindo-kun!

17:44.090 --> 17:44.960
There he is!

17:44.960 --> 17:45.960
This way! Hurry up!

17:48.960 --> 17:49.790
Damn it...

17:51.380 --> 17:53.880
Hun... gry...

17:53.880 --> 17:55.260
Over there! Surround him!

17:57.410 --> 17:59.240
I'm sorry, this is all I have on me right now.

18:02.740 --> 18:04.430
There he is!

18:10.400 --> 18:11.980
Where is Milcatopy?

18:12.390 --> 18:13.100
I don't know.

18:13.100 --> 18:14.010
You!

18:14.930 --> 18:17.200
Why do you side with her so much?

18:17.200 --> 18:19.550
She's a dangerous monster, you know?

18:19.550 --> 18:20.210
No, she's not.

18:20.210 --> 18:20.620
What?

18:21.290 --> 18:23.710
She's a whimsical, stupid cat.

18:23.710 --> 18:25.180
Food's all she cares about.

18:25.180 --> 18:26.000
Still...

18:26.800 --> 18:29.870
She relied upon a human failure like me.

18:30.210 --> 18:33.400
For the first time in life, I was found necessary by someone!

18:33.910 --> 18:36.260
So I won't say where she is even if it kills me.

18:37.000 --> 18:38.240
Take him away.

18:38.240 --> 18:39.300
Wait!

18:45.100 --> 18:45.890
You're...

18:46.090 --> 18:47.390
Let me ask one thing.

18:47.860 --> 18:50.850
Are you guys from the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures?

18:50.850 --> 18:53.170
We are Sorabone City Guards!

18:53.170 --> 18:55.570
I see. Then there's no problem.

18:55.570 --> 18:59.900
That bro took care of me, so I'll lend a hand.

18:59.900 --> 19:01.160
Who are you?!

19:01.320 --> 19:03.970
It's not my style to give out my name when asked, but I shall.

19:03.970 --> 19:06.340
The absolute god and the unique god!

19:06.340 --> 19:08.910
Goddess of Victory, yet God of Destruction!

19:10.000 --> 19:12.300
The beautiful soul that has descended to the Earth!

19:12.300 --> 19:15.020
The ruler of the underground world, Shangri-La!

19:15.020 --> 19:18.180
Kyoukya Aireliaea-sama is here!

19:18.810 --> 19:21.000
A-Air... Aireli...

19:21.800 --> 19:29.090
In the underground world, people fainted from ecstasy when I revealed myself...

19:29.090 --> 19:30.730
The surface fails.

19:30.890 --> 19:32.600
You must be a monster, too!

19:32.600 --> 19:34.440
Any non-human being shall be under the jurisdiction of Sorabone-

19:34.440 --> 19:36.540
Who are you calling a monster?!

19:41.920 --> 19:43.930
Hey, don't run away!

19:43.930 --> 19:46.290
I don't mind shooting you guys, you know?!

19:46.290 --> 19:47.380
Wait!

19:47.380 --> 19:49.120
Kyoukya-sama isn't satisfied yet!

19:47.660 --> 19:48.760
Rindou-kun!

19:49.120 --> 19:50.780
Onii-chan!

19:51.120 --> 19:52.080
Cat.

19:52.080 --> 19:52.790
Why are you here?

19:52.790 --> 19:56.700
No. I don't want to say goodbye to you.

19:56.700 --> 19:59.550
Nothing good would happen even if you stayed with me.

19:59.550 --> 20:01.050
That's not true.

20:01.050 --> 20:04.550
I've been happy ever since you picked me up.

20:05.470 --> 20:06.420
You idiot.

20:08.130 --> 20:09.270
Rindou-kun.

20:10.090 --> 20:13.500
You mustn't make girls cry.

20:20.470 --> 20:21.610
Listen...

20:22.340 --> 20:24.610
She's not your family or anything.

20:24.610 --> 20:26.610
Just a cat you picked up, right?

20:26.610 --> 20:28.070
Why do you care that much?

20:28.070 --> 20:31.680
No. She calls me "Onii-chan", so she's my family.

20:32.490 --> 20:34.040
Fine.

20:35.340 --> 20:36.830
I understand.

20:41.010 --> 20:42.320
Toilet cleaning.

20:43.640 --> 20:46.840
At this place, the new staff starts with toilet cleaning!

20:46.840 --> 20:48.030
Get to work.

20:49.270 --> 20:50.290
Yes!

20:53.550 --> 20:57.550
Not like I was wishing for a rosy college life,

20:58.140 --> 21:01.240
but as long as I make it to college, I'll have a happy life.

21:01.240 --> 21:03.100
That's what I always told myself.

21:09.110 --> 21:10.780
Welcome.

21:10.780 --> 21:12.330
This way please.

21:12.330 --> 21:13.940
Two new customers.

21:13.180 --> 21:18.690
A lot has happened, but I don't regret picking up a cat on a Monday.

21:14.340 --> 21:17.110
I heard Dom PÃ©rignon is good.

21:17.110 --> 21:19.210
Let me pour it for you.

21:29.740 --> 21:32.550
One day, Cat said to me suddenly...

21:33.100 --> 21:39.410
The day after we met, you said you'd give me a treat if I answered your questions, right?

21:39.920 --> 21:40.770
Oh yeah.

21:40.770 --> 21:44.050
I answered you, but you didn't give me anything.

21:45.780 --> 21:47.070
I'm disappointed.

21:47.070 --> 21:49.420
I'm really disappointed in you.

22:04.370 --> 22:05.570
There's your treat.

23:39.990 --> 23:41.270
This is Yuuka.

23:41.270 --> 23:43.520
Next week is an episode about Nee-sama.

23:43.520 --> 23:46.960
Her friends from school will show up, too,
so it's simply a bonus episode.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.540
Mother, what are you doing?

23:48.540 --> 23:52.000
Oh, you see, Yuuka's not here today, so I'm the substitute.

23:52.000 --> 23:54.090
Next week: The Melancholy of Chika!
